{
  "id": "PSA.58",
  "number": "58",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 58",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "58",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 58"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "58",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, Al-taschith, Michtam of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do ye indeed speak righteousness, O congregation? do ye judge uprightly, O ye sons of men?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, in heart ye work wickedness; ye weigh the violence of your hands in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wicked are estranged from the womb: they go astray as soon as they be born, speaking lies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their poison",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like the poison of a serpent:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like the deaf adder",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "stoppeth her ear;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which will not hearken to the voice of charmers, charming never so wisely.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Break their teeth, O God, in their mouth: break out the great teeth of the young lions, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them melt away as waters",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "run continually:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he bendeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his bow to shoot",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his arrows, let them be as cut in pieces.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a snail",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "melteth, let",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "every one of them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pass away:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the untimely birth of a woman,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they may not see the sun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before your pots can feel the thorns, he shall take them away as with a whirlwind, both living, and in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous shall rejoice when he seeth the vengeance: he shall wash his feet in the blood of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So that a man shall say, Verily",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a reward for the righteous: verily he is a God that judgeth in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.59",
    "number": "59",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
